# Content Machine (Reels Machine)

When the user asks for Reels, TikToks, Shorts, or short-form video generation,
use the installed Content Machine pack in `.content-machine/`.

1. Read `.content-machine/AGENTS.md` and pick a skill or flow first.
2. Skills live in `.content-machine/skills/` (also linked from `.cursor/skills/`).
3. Flows live in `.content-machine/flows/`.
4. Execute runtime tools with `npx --no-install cm-agent <tool>`.
5. Write artifacts under `runs/<run-id>/`.
6. Do not call an MP4 ready until publish-prep passes.
